    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no \"phase\"? what if this is just what's left? it feels less like a bad mood and more like a fundamental truth. like the person i was was just a temporary thing, and now i'm just the static left over after the signal's gone. it feels like there's no point in trying to fix something that's already fundamentally empty. if the core is gone, why keep the lights on?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
