      "content": "It's understandable to feel this way, especially when in such a deep place. Thoughts like these can make you feel hopeless, but it’s important to hold onto the possibility of change and healing. You are more than a temporary \"phase,\" and although it feels tough now, there is still 'you' that can experience relief, hope, and recovery with the right support. Engaging with a therapist or counselor can provide a space to explore these feelings safely and work through them. Even small steps towards seeking help are a form of bravery, and they can lead to brighter days. You don't have to go through this alone.",
      "source": "target",
